    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρσυ</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρυσι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.707.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyzicus</span>):—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περσύας</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>), ὁ, for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περυσίας </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισύας</span> codd.), <i>last year's wine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.130
			</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περσυνός</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περυσινός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dura4</u>
				97
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				1.50.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv/v A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισυνός</span> codd. Gal.l.c.</div>
